{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"rensu-e-o211","title":"敦煌旧不晓田、灌溉蓄水极濡洽乃耕、不晓作耧犁用水及种而功力费收谷少；皇甫隆到官教作耧犁、教衍溉，岁终所省庸力过半、得谷加五","accounts":[{"id":"rensu-a-4aaf1c1a665d152e1d83","label":"裴注·魏略","text":"敦煌旧不晓田、灌溉蓄水极濡洽乃耕、不晓作耧犁用水及种而功力费收谷少；皇甫隆到官教作耧犁、教衍溉，岁终所省庸力过半、得谷加五","evidence":["rensu-q-f48fda3394f92ab5bf02"]},{"id":"rensu-a-9bdcfd33340b2ec696df","label":"裴注·魏略","text":"敦煌俗妇人作裙挛缩如羊肠用布一匹，皇甫隆禁改之，所省复不訾","evidence":["rensu-q-8c7190abc8cc77cc5ed9"]}],"participants":[{"person":"rensu-p0041","role":"教耕者；禁改者","evidence":["rensu-q-f48fda3394f92ab5bf02","rensu-q-8c7190abc8cc77cc5ed9"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["rensu-q-f48fda3394f92ab5bf02","rensu-q-8c7190abc8cc77cc5ed9"]},"ordering_evidence":"rensu-q-f48fda3394f92ab5bf02","source_order":[16,373,59],"order":3464}],"persons":[{"id":"rensu-p0041","name":"皇甫隆","evidence":["rensu-q-f48fda3394f92ab5bf02","rensu-q-8c7190abc8cc77cc5ed9"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"rensu-q-8c7190abc8cc77cc5ed9","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-3e5b9b12d5342d616cd2","layer":"pei","quote":"又敦煌俗：妇人作裙，挛缩如羊肠，用布一匹；隆又禁改之，所省复不訾","attribution":"裴注·魏略","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":372,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-1dd7fbac51c831f1dce4","start":140,"end":172},{"id":"rensu-q-f48fda3394f92ab5bf02","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-3e5b9b12d5342d616cd2","layer":"pei","quote":"初，敦煌不甚晓田，常灌溉蓄水，使极濡洽，然后乃耕；又不晓作耧犁、用水及种：人牛功力既费，而收谷更少。隆到，教作耧犁，又教衍溉。岁终率计：其所省庸力过半，得谷加五","attribution":"裴注·魏略","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":372,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-1dd7fbac51c831f1dce4","start":59,"end":139}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
